---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article>
    <h1>About me</h1>

    <section class="bio">
      <p>
        I am Abhirath, and I like to keep my curiosity alive. Professionally, I have been a product manager and a consultant. Outside my core work, I love to dive deeper into topics of interest, cultivate hobbies and keep myself fit.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is an attempt to bring my weird explorations and projects out in the world.
      </p>
      <p class="socials">
        Find me on <a href="https://x.com/trendingchariot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhirathsharma/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I'm up to now</h2>
      <p class="date">Updated December 2025</p>
      <p>
        Exploring my interests in economics, biology, product management and AI. Some of these will be published here.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Books I liked recently</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Narrative Economics</li>
        <li>Empire of Pain</li>
        <li>What Went Wrong with Capitalism</li>
        <li>Steve Jobs biography</li>
        <li>The Intelligence Trap</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .bio p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .socials {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .date {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
